============================================================

FORCE JOIN

============================================================

Current V2 code has these channels hard-coded in config.py:

@SkillShareBDCommunity

@BlackoutZoneRBX404

Therefore there are currently NO .env variables for them.

If you want these configurable from Railway, ask Claude to

move FORCE_JOIN_CHANNELS into environment variables.

============================================================

MANUAL PAYMENT

============================================================

RBX404_BKASH=01838372430
RBX404_NAGAD=01732466920

============================================================

STORE / RESERVATION

============================================================

Account reservation timeout in minutes

RBX404_RESERVATION_MINUTES=15

============================================================

DATABASE

============================================================

SQLite database path

RBX404_DB=./data/rbx404.sqlite3

0 = SQLite

1 = PostgreSQL

RBX404_USE_PG=0

============================================================

POSTGRESQL

============================================================

Only required when RBX404_USE_PG=1

Example:

postgresql://rbx:password@postgres:5432/rbx404

Railway PostgreSQL example:

postgresql://postgres:PASSWORD@HOST:PORT/railway

RBX404_PG_DSN=

============================================================

BACKUPS

============================================================

RBX404_BACKUP=./backups

============================================================

OVPN

============================================================

RBX404_OVPN_TPL=./ovpn/template.ovpn

RBX404_OVPN_OUT=./data/ovpn_out

============================================================

WEBHOOK

============================================================

Your public HTTPS domain

Example:

https://vpn.example.com

RBX404_PUBLIC_URL=https://YOUR-DOMAIN-HERE

Telegram webhook path

RBX404_WEBHOOK_PATH=/webhook/rbx404

IMPORTANT:

Replace this with a long random secret.

Do NOT use CHANGE_ME in production.

RBX404_WEBHOOK_SECRET=CHANGE_THIS_TO_A_LONG_RANDOM_SECRET

============================================================

WEB SERVER

============================================================

Docker / Railway container port

RBX404_PORT=8080